      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اثمل</span></b>  <i>It</i> (a thing, S, or milk, TA) <i>had much</i>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثُمَالَة</span>, i. e., <i>froth;</i> (S, * TA;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثمّل</span></b> . (TA.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اثملت</span> <i>She</i> (a camel) <i>gave much froth in her
milk.</i> (TA in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حلب</span>.) ＝   
